{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49539","headline":"菩萨蛮 三 · 尹鹗","name":"菩萨蛮 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦茵闲衬丁香枕，银釭烬落犹慵寝。\n顒坐遍红炉，谁知情绪孤。\n少年狂荡惯，花曲长牵绊。\n去便不归来，空教骏马回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尹鹗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49539.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49539","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}